# 📘 Go 1.27.1 — `go` Command Reference

## 📋 All Commands at a Glance

| Command | Purpose |
|---|---|
| `go bug` | Open browser to start bug report |
| `go build` | Compile packages & dependencies |
| `go clean` | Remove object files & caches |
| `go doc` | Show package/symbol documentation |
| `go env` | Print/configure Go environment |
| `go fix` | Apply static-analysis code fixes |
| `go fmt` | Format source files via `gofmt` |
| `go generate` | Run `//go:generate` directives |
| `go get` | Add/update dependencies in `go.mod` |
| `go install` | Build & install binaries |
| `go list` | Query package/module info |
| `go mod` | Module maintenance |
| `go run` | Compile + run program |
| `go telemetry` | Manage telemetry settings |
| `go test` | Run test suite |
| `go tool` | Run specific Go toolchain program |
| `go version` | Print Go version |
| `go vet` | Report code problems |
| `go work` | Workspace maintenance |

> Full help: `go help <command>` or `go help <topic>`

